#: ../../source/functions/gadgets/performance_chart.md:23
msgid "In the FlexDesigner"
msgstr "FlexDesigner で"

#: ../../source/functions/gadgets/performance_chart.md:25
msgid "There are various options in the FlexDesigner for this key."
msgstr "FlexDesigner には、このキー用のさまざまなオプションがあります。"

#: ../../source/functions/gadgets/performance_chart.md:27
msgid "![1744945431898](image/performance_chart/1744945431898.png)"
msgstr "![1744945431898](image/performance_chart/1744945431898.png)"

